**Goal:** Everything the desktop does, working in a browser tab.

**Tasks:**
- the terminal over the WebSocket;
- files, editor, git and pql end to end;
- highlighting and Lua, as Q-52(f) decides (this settles T-26);
- clipboard and image paste;
- keymap conflicts with browser-reserved shortcuts (D-54);
- small screens (Q-26);
- web accessibility (Q-13, Q-12).

**Acceptance:**
- The Playwright suite exercises each surface against the container.
- No desktop regression.', 'backlog', 'medium', NULL, NULL, 'Q-52', '2026-09-23 14:29:28.474', '2026-09-23 14:29:28.639', NULL, '435a66380b938c0bbf502cee5eb271d6', 2) ON CONFLICT(record_id) DO UPDATE SET type=excluded.type, parent_record_id=excluded.parent_record_id, title=excluded.title, description=excluded.description, status=excluded.status, priority=excluded.priority, assigned_to=excluded.assigned_to, team=excluded.team, decision_ref=excluded.decision_ref, updated_at=excluded.updated_at, deleted_at=excluded.deleted_at, hash=excluded.hash, canonical_version=excluded.canonical_version WHERE excluded.updated_at >= tickets.updated_at;
